 C Arts Hour\, and has been part of SF Sketchfest\, SF Comedy Day\, and the 
 Asian-American Comedy Festival in LA. She hosts her very successful weekly 
 political comedy podcast The Bitchuation Room\, performs regularly at the I
 mprov and the Ice House\, where she hosts her sold out monthly show\, New W
 orld Disorder\, and tours comedy clubs across the country co-headlining wit
 h her husband\, Matt Lieb.\n\nMatt Lieb is a stand up comedian and co-host 
